<code>assert \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(size); this.get(i) == (\old(this.get(i+1)) == null ? null : \old(this.get(i+1)));</code>

However, since the `get` method would throw an `IndexOutOfBoundsException` if `i+1` is out of bounds, we need to ensure that `i+1` is within the valid range. Therefore, the correct assertion should be:

<code>assert \forall int i; index <= i && i < \old(size); this.get(i) == (\old(i+1) < \old(size) ? \old(this.get(i+1)) : null);</code>

